    - target: {fileID: 4711005256018735203, guid: 0daf8292e6fd6cf46a68c89d3a946ace, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Bureaucracy was Created during the 2025 \"Truth, lies & Democracy\"
        Gamejam at the Belvedere, in Vienna. As yes shopping won the local gamejam
        of the FH Salzburg, the FH Salzburg enabled us to participate at this jam.
        The game is about checking ballots for their validity & Sorting them, and
        was created for a subcategory to display the innerworkings and challenges
        of democracy. Our group of 4 won this category with this title.\n\nGamePlay:
        \nThe player recieves a ballot, checks it, and scans it if it is valid; otherwise
        they put it in the shredder. Over time, multiple rules are added, making
        identifying the correct ballot harder.\n\nWhat I Did:\nProgramming of animations,\nProgramming
        of some game logic,\n3D art,\nsome game design\n\nMade with:\nC#, Unity &
        blender\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4777442187503966490, guid: 0daf8292e6fd6cf46a68c89d3a946ace, type: 3}
